    HasBreakPoint: 0
    TutorialSteps:
    - message: Look upon these Vetruni training for their upcoming battle. They wield
        the wind powers of forest spirits and are able to <b>push others</b> in battle.If
        you wish to see their ability, <b>click</b> on them or their portrait to
        access their <b>Information Panel</b>.
      uiElement: 0
    - message: Their decisions are yours to order, within the <b>Turn Order Bar</b>.
        <b>Drag the portraits</b> of the mages in the order you wish them to take.
      uiElement: 1
    - message: This is your <b>main objective</b> for this event, the <b>Fated Goal</b>.
        To succeed, you must fulfill it.
      uiElement: 0
    - message: When you are ready to see your choices transpire, <b>press</b> the
        <b>Play</b> button.
      uiElement: 1
    - message: If you want to try another strategy, <b>press</b> the <b>Restart</b>
        button.
      uiElement: 0
